{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22894","headline":"山中问月 · 白居易","name":"山中问月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲问长安月，谁教不相离。\n昔随飞盖处，今照入山时。\n借助秋怀旷，留连夜卧迟。\n如归旧乡国，似对好亲知。\n松下行爲伴，谿头坐有期。\n千岩将万壑，无处不相随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}